      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-gothru-dashboard-4129",
      "display_title": "Issue #4129: Add delete (hide) action to Featured Photographers support list",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Context</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Support agents need a way to remove a photographer request from the GoThru Photographer request list on <code class=\"notranslate\">/support/featured-photographers</code> without deleting the underlying request data or touching the photographer's GoThru account. The backend proxy is already available:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">PATCH /photographers/support/delete-flag</code> — body <code class=\"notranslate\">{ \"gothruUserId\": number, \"isDeleted\": boolean }</code> (super-user only).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related API task: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4934430539\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New/issues/1688\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New/issues/1688/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New/issues/1688\">GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New#1688</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">On <code class=\"notranslate\">/support/featured-photographers</code>, add a delete action to each row in the action cell (currently <strong>Review</strong> and <strong>Login</strong>):</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Icon-only button (<code class=\"notranslate\">fa-trash-can</code>, danger / flat) with a <strong>\"Delete Request\"</strong> tooltip, placed to the <strong>left of Review</strong>.</li>\n<li>Opens the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">DeleteModal</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">@pages/Photographer/Components/DeleteModal</code>) for confirmation — the dashboard has no un-hide UI, so a mis-click can only be undone through the API. Copy: <em>\"{name} will be removed from the GoThru Photographer request list. The request data itself is kept and not deleted.\"</em></li>\n<li>On confirm, call <code class=\"notranslate\">PATCH /photographers/support/delete-flag</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">{ gothruUserId, isDeleted: true }</code>.</li>\n<li>On success: toast + refetch the list at the current page / limit / search / filter, so pagination totals stay correct.</li>\n<li>On error: toast the API error (400 invalid id, 404 photographer not found, 403 non super-user).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Files</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/pages/Support/FeaturedPhotographers.jsx</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Notes</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Reuses <code class=\"notranslate\">usePatch</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">src/hooks/useRequest.jsx</code>), NextUI <code class=\"notranslate\">Tooltip</code>, and the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">DeleteModal</code> — no new hook or component.</li>\n<li>Modal title/description and the tooltip use plain English strings, matching the rest of this page, so no new i18n keys are added across the locale files.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Follow-up</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Deleting the last row on the last page leaves an empty page; step the page back if it becomes a problem.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> No un-hide (<code class=\"notranslate\">isDeleted: false</code>) action in the dashboard yet.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo from Developer</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">Screen.Recording.2026-07-22.154318.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-f96ed713-f283-41e5-a79a-97f0cc659af6.mp4\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-f96ed713-f283-41e5-a79a-97f0cc659af6.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
